{"id": "3195354", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3195354", "title": "Australian Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu masculin", "text": "Australian Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu masculin a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii ianuarie 2025. \u0218aizeci \u0219i patru de perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului australian de Grand Slam disputat la Melbourne Park. Rohan Bopanna \u0219i Matthew Ebden au fost campionii \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar au ales s\u0103 nu participe \u00eempreun\u0103. Bopanna a f\u0103cut pereche cu Nicol\u00e1s Barrientos \u0219i a pierdut \u00een fa\u021ba lui Pedro Mart\u00ednez \u0219i Jaume Munar \u00een prima rund\u0103. Ebden l-a avut ca partener pe Joran Vliegen, dar au pierdut \u00een fa\u021ba lui Austin Krajicek \u0219i Rajeev Ram \u00een prima rund\u0103.\nHarri Heli\u00f6vaara \u0219i Henry Patten au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu masculin la Australian Open 2025, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-i \u00een final\u0103 pe italienii Simone Bolelli \u0219i Andrea Vavassori, cu 6\u20137(16\u201318), 7\u20136(7\u20135), 6\u20133.\nTabloul principal.\nFinal\u0103.\n&lt;section begin=\"mdublu\" /&gt;\n&lt;section end=\"mdublu\" /&gt;"}
